{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11113220","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11113220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1111322001:0":{"text":"자, 이제 너희가 말하는 보물이 뭔지 들어나 보자.","source_cn":"说说看，你们所谓的宝藏，究竟是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECDC4D6E8135A0D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111322002:0":{"text":"퉤! 내가 왜 알려줘야 하지? 누구 좋으라고!","source_cn":"呸！你想知道我就告诉你啊？哪有这种好事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19694993501A6E63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111322003:0":{"text":"네가 다음으로 할 말이 내가 원하는 대답이 아니라면...","source_cn":"如果你的下一句话，不能给出我想听到的答案。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC18FE9F42F669991","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111322004:0":{"text":"방금 내뱉은 그 말이 네 마지막 유언이 될 거야.","source_cn":"那么，这就是你的最后一句话了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x157D08F4B62723FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111322005:0":{"text":"지, 진정해! 아, 알겠어! 말할게. 말한다고!","source_cn":"别、别这样，小哥，我说！我说还不行吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D0435557EACEF74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111322006:1":{"text":"빨리 말하는 게 좋을 거야.","source_cn":"我的耐心有限。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9886BF4C6D96E420","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111322007:0":{"text":"보물은... <style=\"highlight\">처음부터 없었어!</style>","source_cn":"宝藏……<style=highlight>根本不存在！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F386312A046342","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111322008:1":{"text":"그럼, 블랙골드 상회의 목적이 뭐지?","source_cn":"那么，黑金商会的目的是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FB8F7684729B0B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111322009:0":{"text":"석양의 신의 무덤을 파는 거야!","source_cn":"打开残阳神的墓穴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x851A6AEEC0E70DA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111322010:0":{"text":"가짜 소문에 속은 사람들이 석양의 신의 무덤을 파내기를 바라고 있었어!","source_cn":"我们希望那些上当的人过来，打开残阳神的墓穴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30774E5C0F62103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111322011:0":{"text":"도굴...? 너희가 원하는 게 뭔데?","source_cn":"盗墓……你们想得到什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D